## 2. Technology stack (locked)

| Layer | Required | Notes |
|-------|----------|-------|
| App | React Native **bare workflow** | `android/`, `ios/` native dirs required |
| Min OS | Android API 26+, iOS 15+ | |
| Native module | **ScanEngine** Turbo Module / JSI | All I/O, hash, index, delete on native executors |
| Index | SQLite single merged catalog | Schema per `docs/architecture.md` §5 |
| Hash | SHA-256 streaming (1 MiB buffer) | `EMPTY:0`, `TEXT_NFC_LF`, `RAW_BYTES`, `VIDEO_CONTENT_V1` only in v1 |
| UI styling | `StyleSheet` + `tokens.ts` | No runtime theme switching v1 |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions + Fastlane | Tag-push matrix; internal/prod lanes |

**Sign-off build:** When `./build.sh` exists, run it before task sign-off (`senior-standards.mdc`). Until scaffolded (M1-01), run the closest project-equivalent checks (native unit tests, lint) documented in the PR or task.

