### ScanOrchestrator (M1-19)

- **Android package:** `com.dupbuster.scanengine.scan` — `ScanOrchestrator`, `ScanOrchestratorFactory`, `ScanStartRequestParser`, `ScanRootResolver`, `ProductionScanDiscoveryRunner`.
- **iOS package:** `ScanEngine/Scan/` — `DBScanOrchestrator`, `DBScanOrchestratorFactory`, `DBScanStartRequestParser`, `DBScanRootResolver`, `DBProductionScanDiscoveryRunner`.
