## 9. Milestones and definition of done

Work must respect **dependency order:** M1 ScanEngine (critical path) → M2 RN shell (mock bridge OK after M1 week 1) → M3 actions/integrity → M4 release hardening.

| Milestone | Do not mark done until |
|-----------|-------------------------|
| **M1** | Fixture matrix green offline; progress ≤4 Hz; schema matches architecture; video pipeline + `VIDEO_DECODE_FAILED` covered |
| **M2** | Catalog + a11y ACs; frozen EN tokens; live bridge where M1 complete |
| **M3** | Two-step delete; TOCTOU + perm-revoke + resume ACs; `DeleteCoordinator` isolated |
| **M4** | FGS + RedactionFilter CI gates; store checklist; prod promote gates in implementation-plan §6.2 |

**Internal builds** (Play internal, TestFlight internal) may ship during M1–M3 **without** green redaction gate. **Production** requires all M4 prod promote gates.

