## 12. Decisions (do not relitigate without doc update)

| Decision | Reasoning | Prevents |
|----------|-----------|----------|
| Bare RN + ScanEngine Turbo Module | FGS, JSI, full filesystem APIs | Expo limits, perf regressions |
| Video exception to size-bucket skip | Cross-resolution dupes are v1 scope | Missing `SAME_CONTENT_VIDEO` groups |
| `schema_version` ≠ app semver | Algo changes without forcing app version semantics | Silent stale index after upgrade |
| Separate delete coordinator | Safety + FD isolation | Accidental writes during hash |
| 4 Hz progress + independent a11y cadence | Bridge perf + screen reader usability | Flooded bridge / chatter |
| `EXACT_BYTES` takes precedence over video content match for byte-identical copies | AC-equiv-video-xres-04 | Duplicate competing groups |
| Mock progress stub in M2 until bridge live | Parallel UI track per implementation plan | Blocking UI on full M1 |

